<title>UK: EMAP sells 14 titles for 14.1 million stg.</title>
<headline>EMAP sells 14 titles for 14.1 million stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British publishing group EMAP Plc said on Wednesday it sold 14 business titles and other assets to Quantum Publishing Ltd for a total of 14.1 million stg.</p>
</text>
